WEBVTT

00:08.742 --> 00:16.783
Shiroi mikazuki machi wo miorosu koro ni

00:16.783 --> 00:24.781
Aoi meikyuu kara mashou ga mezame-hajimeru

00:32.298 --> 00:36.102
Tsumibukai kono chijou de, boy

00:36.102 --> 00:39.105
Believing, dreaming

00:39.105 --> 00:42.942
Boku-tachi wa sagashiteru

00:42.942 --> 00:48.073
Tamashii no mezasubeki basho wo

00:49.883 --> 00:58.291
Ah, dore kurai fukai yami hikari ni kaetara

00:58.291 --> 01:02.862
Sekai no iro ga kawaru?

01:02.862 --> 01:05.532
Ah, itsuka kitto

01:05.532 --> 01:13.807
Ah, dore kurai fukai nazo ikutsumo toitara

01:13.807 --> 01:18.767
Rakuen no doa wa hiraku?

01:20.313 --> 01:26.946
Bokura no tabi wo start hajimeyou

01:33.660 --> 01:35.829
Where is it? Where?

01:35.829 --> 01:37.854
Where? Where?

01:38.665 --> 01:40.724
Where? Where?

01:41.134 --> 01:43.193
Where the heck did it go?!

01:43.703 --> 01:46.467
Loki, you and Yamino look too!

01:46.706 --> 01:51.166
Then we can use this Miracle Hat
I purchased through mail order.

01:53.713 --> 01:56.682
Its beak will point in the direction
of what you're looking for.

02:01.721 --> 02:03.780
My 2500 yen!

02:04.124 --> 02:05.682
Yamino...

02:07.861 --> 02:10.659
I can't go on without it!

02:13.733 --> 02:15.064
Um...

02:15.668 --> 02:19.729
Loki, Mayura, Yamino! Hello!

02:20.240 --> 02:24.644
I'm sorry, Reiya. I'm searching for
something really important right now!

02:24.644 --> 02:27.180
If there's something you need,
could it wait until later?

02:27.180 --> 02:30.616
Could this be what you're looking for?

02:31.751 --> 02:33.912
Thanks, Reiya!

02:34.420 --> 02:36.945
This is it! Oh, thank goodness!

02:37.490 --> 02:39.458
I'm glad the wallet got found and all, but...

02:41.961 --> 02:44.759
This is it, this is it, this is it,
this is it, this is it, this is it!

02:44.998 --> 02:46.799
Oh, thank goodness!
I'm starting to question Mayura's taste.

02:46.799 --> 02:47.128
I'm starting to question Mayura's taste.

02:47.700 --> 02:53.161
The 10th Night
Twilight Coffee Shop

02:53.506 --> 02:55.675
I've gotta find a way to thank you, Reiya.

02:55.675 --> 02:58.878
I only did what anyone else would have done.

02:58.878 --> 03:00.747
Please don't worry about it!

03:00.747 --> 03:03.375
I couldn't just let it go at that!

03:06.853 --> 03:10.482
Let me treat you to something from over
there! I can at least do that, right?

03:10.790 --> 03:12.121
Sure!

03:12.859 --> 03:17.262
I'm very sorry, but we're
completely full at the moment.

03:21.434 --> 03:23.698
Please come again!

03:24.837 --> 03:27.307
I can't believe they wouldn't take us.

03:27.307 --> 03:30.677
This place has been quite popular lately,
so it's to be expected.

03:30.677 --> 03:32.577
What other places are around?

03:37.450 --> 03:40.419
Twilight
Coffee Shop
How about that!
There's one right in front of us!

03:42.622 --> 03:43.957
Welcome!

03:43.957 --> 03:45.447
I recognize that voice.

03:47.260 --> 03:49.455
Welcome to... Huh? You guys?!

03:49.862 --> 03:51.420
Narugami!

03:53.099 --> 03:55.568
You certainly have a lot of
part-time jobs, Narugami.

03:55.568 --> 03:56.869
Can I take your order?

03:56.869 --> 03:59.739
You can get anything you like, Reiya.

03:59.739 --> 04:00.967
Okay!

04:01.608 --> 04:04.010
I recommend our coffee.

04:04.010 --> 04:07.013
Well of course, right?
This is a coffee shop, after all.

04:07.013 --> 04:09.015
Don't be silly!

04:09.015 --> 04:11.984
The owner here makes the ultimate coffee.

04:13.086 --> 04:15.855
I don't like bitter things that much...

04:15.855 --> 04:19.552
Then we'll put lots of milk in yours.

04:24.097 --> 04:26.266
Coffee is tricky to make.

04:26.266 --> 04:29.535
Both temperature and humidity
can affect its flavor.

04:29.535 --> 04:31.604
That's why you have to be careful of
how coarsely you grind the beans,

04:31.604 --> 04:33.231
keeping an eye on the temperature as well.

04:35.308 --> 04:36.605
Sorry for the wait.

04:51.057 --> 04:52.792
Delicious!

04:52.792 --> 04:54.294
Oh, yes!

04:54.294 --> 04:55.886
I'm impressed!

04:56.329 --> 04:58.164
Thank you very much.

04:58.164 --> 05:02.001
The owner here puts his heart and soul into
every cup, so of course it's delicious.

05:02.001 --> 05:04.401
No other coffee can come close!

05:04.570 --> 05:08.529
Then why aren't there any
other customers here?

05:14.914 --> 05:17.109
How dare you speak that way, Loki?!

05:17.750 --> 05:19.081
It is truth, though.

05:19.619 --> 05:21.246
Well actually...

05:22.255 --> 05:24.052
A mysterious case?!

05:25.024 --> 05:28.755
Yes. Strange things started
happening here all of a sudden.

05:29.495 --> 05:31.197
A strange mystery!

05:31.197 --> 05:32.765
"Strange things"?

05:32.765 --> 05:35.601
It's not always the same thing.

05:35.601 --> 05:38.271
If you were to see, I think you'd
understand what I mean.

05:38.271 --> 05:41.407
My customers became disturbed
and walked out.

05:41.407 --> 05:43.534
My assistant quit too.

05:43.776 --> 05:47.576
That's why I landed the job without
even having an interview.

05:47.914 --> 05:52.317
If this continues, I'll have no choice
but to close the shop.

05:52.618 --> 05:54.085
You can't do that!

05:55.955 --> 05:57.081
I've got a bad feeling.

05:57.857 --> 06:00.587
You just leave it to us, sir!

06:00.960 --> 06:03.229
Let's bring the business back
to this coffee shop!

06:03.229 --> 06:06.392
It's a waste to have such delicious
coffee just sitting here!

06:07.433 --> 06:10.136
Seems all she really wants is
another mystery to investigate.

06:10.136 --> 06:11.771
It's not like that!

06:11.771 --> 06:14.674
Sure I'm glad to come across a mystery,
but that's another matter!

06:14.674 --> 06:17.472
You and Yamino will help out too, right?

06:18.344 --> 06:19.679
You want me to help?

06:19.679 --> 06:21.013
Well, of course.

06:21.013 --> 06:23.140
You weren't thinking about
saying no, were you?

06:24.450 --> 06:26.179
Guess I don't have a choice.

06:27.787 --> 06:30.255
Um... Can I help too?

06:31.190 --> 06:32.692
Sure you can help!

06:32.692 --> 06:33.659
Okay!

06:34.127 --> 06:35.617
Thank you all so much.

06:35.895 --> 06:37.730
Aim high! Let's double our sales!

06:37.730 --> 06:39.129
Commence operation!

06:39.632 --> 06:41.395
Jeez...

06:42.068 --> 06:45.697
Why can't my dad come and
inspect his own shop, at least?!

06:46.339 --> 06:47.573
It really is delicious.

06:47.573 --> 06:48.441
Let's go try it out.

06:48.441 --> 06:49.271
Yeah, let's go.

06:54.914 --> 06:56.279
Welcome!

06:59.719 --> 07:01.186
Oh! Hey, Kotaro!

07:01.988 --> 07:03.853
What are you doing, Daidoji?

07:04.891 --> 07:08.190
This is part of our plan to bring business back
to this shop, Enjaku Detective Agency style!

07:09.829 --> 07:12.696
Yamino's attracting all the older women
with his cooking tutorials.

07:13.132 --> 07:15.234
Me and Reiya are taking care of the guys,

07:15.234 --> 07:17.702
and Loki's winning over the girls
with that smile of his.

07:18.137 --> 07:20.662
That's our plan to bring in the customers.

07:20.973 --> 07:23.669
Well, now. It sounds like you're having fun.

07:27.113 --> 07:28.842
Oh, stop!

07:30.249 --> 07:31.350
How about another cup?
You wanna go out?

07:31.350 --> 07:31.851
How about another cup?
Huh? C'mon, let's go out...

07:31.851 --> 07:33.318
Huh? C'mon, let's go out...

07:36.088 --> 07:39.489
We'll have way more women
coming in now, thanks to Kotaro.

07:43.262 --> 07:45.264
For cryin' out loud...

07:45.264 --> 07:47.755
Why do I have to clean the toilets?

08:00.780 --> 08:04.150
Twelve rolls of toilet paper for
the special price of 100 yen.

08:04.150 --> 08:05.742
Limit three per customer.

08:07.386 --> 08:09.889
Man, that was some great shopping.

08:09.889 --> 08:14.126
Frey, why do I have to help out
with your shopping?

08:14.126 --> 08:18.085
Because two people can obviously buy
more than one person alone.

08:18.264 --> 08:20.255
If you don't understand that, well...

08:21.300 --> 08:22.767
In any case...

08:28.708 --> 08:31.074
What the heck is Loki doing?

08:31.644 --> 08:36.081
This free candy is from us to
all of you waiting out here.

08:36.949 --> 08:39.577
Smile harder, Loki, smile!

08:40.720 --> 08:44.178
Our shop is giving out free candy!

08:44.690 --> 08:46.089
This is tiring.

08:46.759 --> 08:49.262
I want to go to that store over there.

08:49.262 --> 08:51.264
I want to see the classic Japanese beauty.

08:51.264 --> 08:54.667
Don't be absurd.
That place is completely packed.

08:54.667 --> 08:56.225
That leaves me no choice then...

08:56.869 --> 09:00.168
I'd like three more Golden Delicious Parfaits!

09:09.282 --> 09:10.550
Can you believe that?

09:10.550 --> 09:11.676
Are you for real?!

09:20.393 --> 09:22.061
Ah, I'm beat.

09:22.061 --> 09:23.255
Me too.

09:23.696 --> 09:25.994
My thanks. This is all thanks to your help.

09:26.332 --> 09:29.995
I haven't made coffee like this
in a long time.

09:30.202 --> 09:35.037
Your coffee is great. It would've turned out
like this even if we hadn't helped out.

09:35.841 --> 09:37.638
You flatter me.

09:43.215 --> 09:44.546
What's that?

09:44.951 --> 09:46.919
I was taken by this piece
when I first laid eyes on it.

09:46.919 --> 09:50.446
It's a treasure I received even though
I had no money to pay for it.

09:51.023 --> 09:54.515
It's almost like a partner who's been
with me through thick and thin.

09:55.928 --> 09:59.056
I know how you feel.
I have a partner of my own too.

10:00.166 --> 10:04.227
Whether hungry or full,
we're always together.

10:04.670 --> 10:09.471
It seems this will be a day to remember,
so I thought I'd use this cup too.

10:13.846 --> 10:15.973
Here. Please take care of this one.

10:17.016 --> 10:18.142
Yes, sir!

10:45.911 --> 10:48.004
Mystery...

10:49.582 --> 10:51.250
Are you all right?

10:51.250 --> 10:52.877
Were you hurt?

10:53.886 --> 10:55.521
That is too creepy.

10:55.521 --> 10:56.647
Let's go.

11:28.187 --> 11:29.622
Twilight
Coffee Shop

11:29.622 --> 11:31.624
Twilight
Coffee Shop
This is how it always is.

11:31.624 --> 11:32.147
Twilight
Coffee Shop

11:33.492 --> 11:37.163
As soon as things start going well for
the shop, something strange happens.

11:37.163 --> 11:40.291
Why does it always come to this?

11:41.667 --> 11:45.626
Maybe it'd be better if I just
closed my doors for good.

11:47.206 --> 11:48.673
Sir...

11:59.652 --> 12:01.554
I feel sorry for the owner.

12:01.554 --> 12:04.148
I wonder why that kind of
stuff is happening?

12:05.758 --> 12:07.453
Well, Loki?

12:13.933 --> 12:15.628
Master Loki?

12:32.785 --> 12:36.186
You can go home now, Narugami.

12:36.489 --> 12:39.458
I've just got a little bit more to do.
After all, we're open tomorrow.

12:40.126 --> 12:41.794
Tomorrow, huh?

12:41.794 --> 12:45.161
Even if we are open, I don't know
if we'll have any customers.

12:46.065 --> 12:48.863
All your cleaning may be in vain.

12:50.102 --> 12:52.866
I really like your coffee.

12:54.006 --> 12:57.635
Because you put a lot of love
into each and every cup.

12:59.311 --> 13:01.074
Thank you.

13:01.547 --> 13:03.174
But enough is enough.

13:06.986 --> 13:09.614
Just let me finish this up and then I'll go.

13:19.265 --> 13:21.756
Okay then. I'll leave it to you.

13:58.571 --> 14:01.039
What do you think you're doing, Loki?

14:03.642 --> 14:05.837
You'd better have a real good
explanation for this!

14:08.113 --> 14:10.707
Haven't you noticed, Narugami?

14:13.819 --> 14:15.955
It's the evil vat, Bodn.

14:15.955 --> 14:18.691
A ritual was performed to
purge Bodn's evil,

14:18.691 --> 14:21.160
but the evil transferred from the vat
to a cup used in the ritual.

14:21.160 --> 14:24.459
That cup now brings bad luck
to whoever uses it.

14:28.434 --> 14:30.603
A cup that brings bad luck?

14:30.603 --> 14:33.071
This is what's behind all the weird
things that've been going on?

14:34.240 --> 14:37.732
If you really want to help the owner,
there's one way to do so.

14:50.623 --> 14:52.024
I can't do it.

14:52.024 --> 14:53.491
Narugami?

14:54.026 --> 14:56.161
This cup is very important to him.

14:56.161 --> 14:59.131
I can't destroy it, no matter the reason.

14:59.131 --> 15:02.301
My Mjolnir might seem like
an ordinary tool to you,

15:02.301 --> 15:06.260
but to me it's a partner I trust
more than anyone in the world.

15:06.906 --> 15:10.576
If it had become possessed by evil
and you told me to get rid of it,

15:10.576 --> 15:12.703
do you really think I'd be able to?

15:15.347 --> 15:17.683
All the precious time I've spent with Mjolnir

15:17.683 --> 15:19.981
isn't something I could just
throw away so easily.

15:20.753 --> 15:23.586
I'm sure my boss feels the same.

15:24.523 --> 15:26.150
I can't smash it!

15:27.660 --> 15:32.064
So you're saying that you wouldn't
mind if your dear Mjolnir

15:32.064 --> 15:34.760
decided to hurt others, is that it?

15:35.267 --> 15:36.435
What?!

15:36.435 --> 15:41.840
Things possessed by evil are controlled by
an evil will, and they will try to cause harm.

15:41.840 --> 15:44.910
But basically, you're saying that even if it
forgot about your "precious time" together

15:44.910 --> 15:48.175
and went on a destructive rampage,
you'd still defend Mjolnir?!

15:49.748 --> 15:53.115
Quiet! I... I...

15:54.887 --> 15:56.684
Oh, no! Let go of that cup!

16:42.701 --> 16:43.936
This is...

16:43.936 --> 16:45.164
Am I too late?

16:54.113 --> 16:59.608
Evil calls evil. Bodn has absorbed
enough evil energy to run amuck.

17:05.924 --> 17:10.629
The force of this power is more than
enough to bring bad luck.

17:10.629 --> 17:13.154
It's enough to endanger lives!

17:14.099 --> 17:16.226
Do you still plan on just letting it be?

17:19.972 --> 17:22.770
If we act now, we can stop this thing!

17:27.679 --> 17:30.307
What would you do, Mjolnir?

17:59.578 --> 18:01.045
Come on, Loki.

18:42.454 --> 18:43.555
Twilight
Coffee Shop

18:43.555 --> 18:45.224
Twilight
Coffee Shop
Good morning.

18:45.224 --> 18:45.553
Twilight
Coffee Shop

18:46.792 --> 18:49.090
I'll be looking forward to your
help today, Narugami.

18:49.528 --> 18:51.325
I'm so sorry, sir!

18:51.997 --> 18:53.965
My hand slipped.

18:57.336 --> 18:58.735
My cup!

19:00.539 --> 19:03.838
I know how much it meant to you, sir.

19:04.643 --> 19:06.338
I truly am sorry.

19:10.215 --> 19:13.309
I don't know if there's anything
I could offer you in exchange,

19:17.289 --> 19:19.291
but here is my partner.

19:19.291 --> 19:21.725
Do with it as you please.

19:47.753 --> 19:51.746
All things break eventually.
Don't worry about it.

19:52.457 --> 19:53.926
But, I...

19:53.926 --> 19:55.450
It's all right.

19:56.495 --> 20:00.295
You've already given me
something in exchange.

20:02.100 --> 20:04.830
I wanted people to drink delicious coffee.

20:06.572 --> 20:08.938
I wanted to bring smiles to
my customers' faces.

20:09.074 --> 20:10.974
TOTAL

20:11.710 --> 20:14.508
With that desire in mind,
I opened this shop.

20:21.553 --> 20:24.954
Now, thanks to you,
I've remembered my original purpose.

20:43.709 --> 20:46.507
Thank you, Narugami.

20:56.421 --> 20:58.548
All right, I'm going to work hard today!

21:01.627 --> 21:03.662
Huh? What's going on here?

21:03.662 --> 21:04.959
Narugami!

21:07.866 --> 21:10.926
Loki, this is awful.
Who would've done such a thing?

21:12.604 --> 21:12.904
To Narugami

21:12.904 --> 21:14.531
To Narugami
It's from the owner.

21:16.975 --> 21:19.978
I know this is a bit sudden,
but I've decided to go abroad,

21:19.978 --> 21:22.970
and begin my study of coffee all over again.

21:24.049 --> 21:28.850
Therefore, the Twilight Coffee Shop
will be closed for the time being.

21:29.521 --> 21:31.356
Narugami...

21:31.356 --> 21:33.586
Thank you for all you've done.

21:34.660 --> 21:36.355
I see.

21:40.365 --> 21:41.832
Narugami.

21:43.335 --> 21:45.803
Guess it's back to the
job search tomorrow, huh?

21:46.538 --> 21:47.835
Right!

22:17.035 --> 22:29.004
Fukai kiri wo saite tsukiakari ga terashita michi

22:30.682 --> 22:42.427
Daremo mina mayoinagara,
samayotteru ashita e to

22:42.427 --> 22:49.634
Kodoku no machi de kataritsugu shinwa sae

22:49.634 --> 22:55.974
Habamaresou na yami wo nukete yuku

22:55.974 --> 23:05.484
Hatenai sora wo koete tabi wo shite iru

23:05.484 --> 23:09.821
Kizutsuitemo

23:09.821 --> 23:21.833
Boku-tachi wa kitto tadoritsukeru kara,
inori-tsuzuketai

23:21.833 --> 23:23.562
Believe in Heaven

23:31.243 --> 23:31.877
Next Episode

23:31.877 --> 23:35.313
Next Episode
The key words for the episode are,
"club sports," "youth," and "giant battleship."

23:35.313 --> 23:36.515
Next Episode
Hey, Mister Mysterious Thief,

23:36.515 --> 23:38.817
Next Episode
something's been bugging me so much
that I can't even sleep at night!

23:38.817 --> 23:41.052
Next Episode
Hmm? Lack of sleep is bad for your skin!

23:41.052 --> 23:42.387
Next Episode
What's troubling you?

23:42.387 --> 23:44.189
Next Episode
The knowledgeable Frey will tell you
what you need to know.

23:44.189 --> 23:47.793
Next Episode
Really? Okay, so why do they
call it minestrone?

23:47.793 --> 23:49.494
Next Episode
Oh, that?

23:49.494 --> 23:52.464
Next Episode
Well, this guy named Mine first made
that food while he was stroned.

23:52.464 --> 23:54.866
Next Episode
Ah, I see. He was all stroned, and...

23:54.866 --> 23:55.534
Next Episode
Huh?

23:55.534 --> 23:55.700
Next Episode
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.700 --> 23:56.435
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.435 --> 23:57.068
The 11th Night
Transfer Student in Love
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:57.068 --> 23:58.403
The 11th Night
Transfer Student in Love
"Transfer Student in Love"

23:58.403 --> 24:00.405
The 11th Night
Transfer Student in Love
Another strange mystery!

24:00.405 --> 24:01.201
The 11th Night
Transfer Student in Love
